translate brazil ch4sc15_71bcf3b5:

#   lu "*Giggles* Amazity! Although, I already studied the material... when I was nine."
    lu "*Risos* Incrível! Embora eu já tenha estudado essa matéria... quando tinha nove anos."

# game/chapters/chapter4/script/ch4sc15.rpy:36
translate brazil ch4sc15_27715e38:

