    my "*Risos* Oi, linda."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc14.rpy:336
translate brazil ch5sc14_3aaa9480:

#   ast "*Excited* Maya! I'm so glad you could make it! I was worried you'd be too busy to join us for dinner!"
    ast "*Que alegria, Maya! Fico tão feliz que você tenha conseguido vir! Estava preocupada que você estivesse muito ocupada para jantar conosco!"

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc14.rpy:337
translate brazil ch5sc14_76b7fb50:

#   ast "I'm making your favorite! Roasted potatoes and grilled leeks! Daddy tried to object, but to no avail! *Giggles*"
    ast "Estou preparando o seu prato favorito! Batatas assadas e alho-poró grelhado! Papai tentou protestar, mas foi em vão! *Risos*"

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc14.rpy:338
translate brazil ch5sc14_ce377197:

#   gib "All I was saying is it'd be nice with some steak once in a while. *Chuckles*"
