#   "You've successfully taken out the goblins without being noticed, {b}{color=#745099}Stealth{/color}{/b} has increased by {size=+3}{b}{color=#2bff8b}1{/color}{/b}{/size}."
    "Você conseguiu eliminar os goblins sem ser notado. {b}{color=#745099}Furtividade{/color}{/b} aumentou em {size=+3}{b}{color=#2bff8b}1{/color}{/b}{/size}."

# game/chapters/chapter3/script/ch3sc22.rpy:95
