translate brazil ch6sc10_9bc6fa45:

#   mct "To a relaxing day on the ocean with people I care about…"
    mct "Para um dia relaxante no oceano com pessoas que eu amo…"

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:6306
translate brazil ch6sc10_bdb376b8:

#   mct "This is what it’s all about… this is an adventurer’s life."
    mct "É disso que se trata... esta é a vida de um aventureiro."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:6307
translate brazil ch6sc10_8845ca12:

#   mct "But with all adventures comes the longing for home… I may not have a home, yet."
    mct "Mas com todas as aventuras vem a saudade de casa… Talvez eu ainda não tenha um lar."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:6309
translate brazil ch6sc10_e208c232:

#   mct "But that is something I intend to create with Eliza, when time allows it."
    mct "Mas isso é algo que pretendo criar com a Eliza, quando o tempo permitir."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:6310
translate brazil ch6sc10_431c0bbd:

#   mct "*Sighs* It would appear we’ve at least napped for an hour… maybe two?"
    mct "*Suspiro* Parece que pelo menos cochilamos por uma hora... talvez duas?"

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:6311
translate brazil ch6sc10_bbc64422:

#   mct "Okay, enough resting."
    mct "Ok, chega de descansar."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:6313
translate brazil ch6sc10_368a3b2d:

#   mct "I’m getting restless not having done anything active all day."
    mct "Estou ficando inquieto por não ter feito nenhuma atividade física o dia todo."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:6315
translate brazil ch6sc10_95f34af5:

#   mct "Time to rectify that."
    mct "Chegou a hora de corrigir isso."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:6317
translate brazil ch6sc10_7f908565:

#   mct "I could go for a swim like Pearl did, but I’ll just get in a quick workout while the girls finish their nap."
    mct "Eu poderia dar um mergulho como a Pearl fez, mas vou fazer um treino rápido enquanto as meninas terminam a soneca."

# game/chapters/chapter6/ch6sc10.rpy:6326
translate brazil ch6sc10_7a2190e1:

