#   sy "I’ll manage. I got inspired when I saw how hard Eliza was working towards your goal."
    sy "Eu vou conseguir. Fiquei inspirada ao ver o quanto a Eliza estava se esforçando para alcançar seu objetivo."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc2.rpy:3043
translate brazil ch5sc2_1e7794d4:

#   sy "I want to contribute to that goal, to your goal as well."
