#   elt "At one point, I thought he was going to throw me down and ravish me."
    elt "Em um dado momento, pensei que ele fosse me jogar no chão e me violentar."

# game/chapters/chapter2/script/ch2sc6.rpy:139
translate brazil ch2sc6_2e9310d2:

#   elt "If he had done that... I'd have given myself to him, my body and soul wanted it."
    elt "Se ele tivesse feito isso... eu teria me entregado a ele, meu corpo e minha alma desejavam isso."

# game/chapters/chapter2/script/ch2sc6.rpy:141
translate brazil ch2sc6_c3e33820:

#   elt "Heavens... he was so hot!"
    elt "Céus... ele era tão lindo!"

# game/chapters/chapter2/script/ch2sc6.rpy:142
translate brazil ch2sc6_0fe8944e:

#   elt "I'm getting flustered just thinking about if it could happen again tonight... mhh!"
    elt "Só de pensar se isso poderia acontecer de novo hoje à noite, já fico nervosa... mhh!"

# game/chapters/chapter2/script/ch2sc6.rpy:149
translate brazil ch2sc6_a1547baf:

#   elt "Arrhh! Stop it, Eliza!! {b}Focus!{/b}"
    elt "Argh! Pare com isso, Eliza!! {b} Foco!{/b}"

# game/chapters/chapter2/script/ch2sc6.rpy:151
translate brazil ch2sc6_d9e4ff86:

#   elt "You have a goal to achieve..."
    elt "Você tem um objetivo a alcançar..."

# game/chapters/chapter2/script/ch2sc6.rpy:152
translate brazil ch2sc6_6778d91b:

#   elt "Make him regret skipping breakfast! I'll show him no mercy!"
    elt "Faça-o se arrepender de ter pulado o café da manhã! Não terei piedade dele!"



